  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v4.0.0 — Unified release under the RabbitRpc 4.x line.\n- First release of the XPacketRpc adapter against the IRpcSerializer v4 surface (SerializeEnvelope / DeserializeEnvelope / SerializeFragment / DeserializeFragment).\n- Default binary adapter for new and high-throughput RabbitRpc 4.x deployments.\n- Bootstrap primitive codec library (bool / numerics / string / Guid / DateTime / DateTimeOffset / TimeSpan / byte[] / ReadOnlyMemory<byte>).\n- Per-Type compiled FragmentInvokerCache (ConcurrentDictionary<Type, Lazy<FragmentInvoker>> with ExecutionAndPublication).\n- Compatible with RabbitRpc.Client 4.x and RabbitRpc.Server 4.x.",
